#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0352 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "No column matches ANY of the five patterns ^A(\\d+)IND$, ^A(\\d+)LO$, ^A(\\d+)HI$, ^A(\\d+)LOC$, ^A(\\d+)HIC$. Scope pre-gate passes (BDS is in the include list); expander returns NoMatch -> SKIPPED: Template did not match any columns in dataset. Load-bearing pin: without it a reader could believe a dataset carrying no analysis-range variables at all is silently 'conformant'."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | 7
